{comment This is a sample REA story demonstrating all syntax constructs}

# The Enchanted Forest

{set player.name = "Aria"}
{set player.gold = 50}
{set player.items = ["torch", "map"]}

---

Welcome, {player.name}! You stand at the edge of an _enchanted_ forest.
The *ancient* trees whisper secrets in a language you _*almost*_ understand.

= The adventure begins now.

| "Not all who wander are lost," says the sign.
|| But some certainly are.

{define character elena begin}
  name: Elena the Guide
  image: media/elena.png
{end define}

{define role scout begin}
  max: 1
  description: "The one who goes first"
{end define}

[#clearing]

@elena: "Follow me into the forest. I know the way."
@narrator: The path grew narrow and dark.

[!Forest clearing < media/clearing.jpg]
[?Ambient < media/forest-ambience.ogg, volume=0.3, loop]

* {player.gold >= 10} [Pay the toll]
  {set player.gold = player.gold - 10}
  The gate opens with a groan.
  -> bridge

* [Sneak past]
  {if random(1, 6) > 3 begin}
    You slip through unnoticed.
    -> bridge
  {else}
    A guard spots you!
    -> caught
  {end if}

+ [Look around]
  You see a rusty key half-buried in leaves.
  {give rusty_key}
  [@elena] nods approvingly. You pick up [$rusty_key].

- The paths converge.

{function greet(name, title = "adventurer") begin}
  Welcome, {name} the {title}!
{end function}

{greet(player.name)}

{once begin}
  This is your first time here.
{then}
  You've been here before.
{end once}

The door was {first|closed|open|broken}.
Choose a color: {~red|blue|green|yellow}.
The clock strikes {&one|two|three}.

{for item in player.items begin}
  - You have: {item}
{end for}

{while player.gold > 0 begin}
  {set player.gold = player.gold - 1}
{end while}

{switch player.items[0] begin}
  {case "torch"} Light fills the room.
  {case "map"} You know which way to go.
  {default} You proceed carefully.
{end switch}

{require gps}
{waypoint bridge, circle(@(48.14, 17.10), 50) begin}
  You arrive at the old stone bridge.
{end waypoint}

{timer duration=30, on_expire="-> timeout" begin}
  Quick! Cross the bridge before it collapses!
{end timer}

{vote timeout=60 begin}
  * [Go left]
  * [Go right]
{end vote}

{broadcast begin}
  Everyone hears a distant roar.
{end broadcast}

{whisper to="scout" begin}
  Only the scout sees: there are tracks in the mud.
{end whisper}

{voice speed=3, emotion="whisper" begin}
  The cave echoed with ancient whispers...
{end voice}

{input name=player_guess, type="number", min=1, max=100}
{button label="Submit", target=check_guess}

{set shared.score = shared.score + 1}
{todo Add more branching here}

{todo begin}
  Rewrite the ending.
  Then the middle.
{end todo}

{comment begin}
  This section is still being written.
  Don't forget to add the boss fight.
{end comment}

{raw begin}
  This text is {not interpreted} as commands.
  Even [this] stays literal.
{end raw}

## The End

You have {player.gold} gold remaining.
{player.gold > 0 ? "Not bad!" : "Completely broke."}

The journey was {length(player.items)} steps long.
Your score: {abs(shared.score)} / {max(10, shared.score)}.

[Continue > #clearing]
[Read more > https://rea.st]

[^1]: The Enchanted Forest is a well-known location in REA stories.

-----
